    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "there isn't a way to shift the perspective, that's the point. its not just a bad day or burnout. its the sheer weight of it. every single day is exactly the same. it's just this endless, grey cycle of nothing. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i'm just wasting time until i die i guess.",
